<!-- GOAL -->
<section class="section">

<h2>
Better decisions about how work flows
</h2>

<p>

The goal of this platform is not to prescribe
a single way of working.

</p>

<p>

Instead it aims to help leaders and teams:

</p>

<ul>

<li>see their systems more clearly</li>

<li>interpret delivery signals more effectively</li>

<li>experiment with new approaches</li>

